        "cooked": "<div>so my friend and i were playing (one hero each)i was mister fixer and my friend was visionary.</div><div>we were fighting plague rat, in pike.</div><div>we killed plague locust pretty fast but then i died. then my friend draw telekinetic cocoon and then for the rest of the 20 minute game the environment we won but it was not a fun game.</div><div>we trend the same thing with kismet i think with nightmist's misinform but it was destroyed soon after begin played.</div><div>so maybe not broken but maybe not in the \"spirit\" of the game.</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
