        "cooked": "<p>First, welcome to thr forums!</p>\n<p>Second, SotM isn’t meant for only 2 heroes. One person shoild have been playing two heroes, or you can try using one of the two hero variants.</p>\n<p>Third, yes sometimes Telekinetic Cocoon or Mistform can give an easy win, especiallu if the villain doesn’t have Ongoing destruction.</p>",
