        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-02T12:49:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Glad to have you here!</p><p>Yeah, fundamentally the game is a 3-5 hero game. You can play 2 players (we do this often with 2 heroes each) - you can even do 1 player with 3 (or more) heroes - but just playing 2 heroes will be a horrible experience.</p><p>As Pydro mentioned, there are 2-player variants around (both here and on BoardGameGeek.com), although nothing official. I can't vouch for any of them, though, as I've never played them.</p>",
